<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Chitin Plating</ansi> mutation

Overlapping plates of dense chitin lock across your body like a
beetle's shell. (A bridge between the Colossus and Ironhide ways.)

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Heavy natural armor, and the muscle to carry it lends you real
  strength

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  The weight of the plating costs you some of your quickness

